  "scope": [
    "One task-local ordered typed event snapshot for original formLogin/loginAction, separate from deduplicated persistence effects; max128 events/512KiB UTF8 including event metadata; entry capture is checked incrementally.",
    "upLoginData ordered nullable entries, null reset distinct from empty Map; render(false)/refreshExplore accepted; render(true) rejected before acceptance.",
    "Snapshots retained through normal result, script/HTTP errors, cancellation/deadline, DTO decode and native session close failure, with independent primary and secondary failures.",
    "Existing source actor/executor/process/credential owners; synchronous JVM callback only records task-local facts, never reenters its locked source; existing View owner consumes after gate release.",
    "Raw rows and UTF16-first-name matching, independent row controls and selector index, hidden/empty Map, button caption only, captured toggle cycle value/name and old listener-map identity after reset.",
    "Same user/programmatic changed-text600ms debounce, init/same-value suppressed; owned FIFO retains busy actions and per-chain automatic-listener128 explicit STATE_LIMIT; new human chains stay usable.",
    "False rerender uses control/evaluation Map separately from working Map; error keeps prior valid rows; generation/load/disappear cancellation gates obsolete state."
  ],
